flowchart LR
    A[同一条 VarmorPolicy
AppArmorBPFSeccomp + EnhanceProtect]

    A --> B1[AppArmor 分支]
    A --> B2[BPF 分支]
    A --> B3[Seccomp 分支]

    B1 --> C1[AppArmor 文本规则
如 audit deny /etc/shadow r]
    B2 --> C2[BpfContent 结构
Files Networks Capabilities Ptrace Mounts]
    B3 --> C3[Seccomp JSON
syscalls + action + args]

    C1 --> D1[profile.AppArmor]
    C2 --> D2[profile.Bpf]
    C3 --> D3[profile.Seccomp]

    D1 --> E[同一个 ArmorProfile.Spec.Profile]
    D2 --> E
    D3 --> E